ps://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVM8Kn0K.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/kevinnbass/status/2100694547101630565?s=61", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Rho Khana gets more money from AI companies than any other member of Congress", "last_comment_created": 1789699115999, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 1, "score_up": 29, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": [{"width": 3918, "heightRatio": 104, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HScqh3IWoAENMJW.jpg", "height": 4096}], "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 146, "created": 1789679583000, "id": "2100694547101630565", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1947236538409988096/hZXVsMlX_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Kevin Bass", "username": "kevinnbass"}, "content": "Many of the most vocal politicians now calling for government regulation of AI companies are also among those receiving the most money from the AI companies themselves.\n\nWhat an intriguing coincidence.", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 2410}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVM9RGJb", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 11, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8842247, "raw_content": "Seriously, I am pro Trump. Yes, I am Australian.  But we down under need a Trump.  Yes, we speak differently to you guys. Our sense of humour and spelling can be confusing. But can we stop with the bot attacks and hate shit buggarising around?  \nAll around the world, people look to Donald Trump and what is wrong with that? Why do the lefties infest this place? Why? Because they hate us. \nI write serious articles and I write satire.  I have been here for quite a while. But lately, I have noticed a shift. There is nasty creeping in. I do not mind a bit of bullshit.. I often write bullshit.  But I do not come here to read the other kind of bullshit. My bullshit is writing about mystical mountains and rat reporters, not shit pretending to be factual. Can we just get back to being a place where we can come to appreciate the greatest President you have ever had and tell the trolls to fuck off please?\nIf I wanted to dump on Trump I would not be here.  \nMy wee blog is unashamedly pro Trump, pro historical fact and some personal observations. It also contains some satirical articles that stretch the bounds of human comprehension. \nDo I come here for the \" pleasure \" of reading crap from bots and hate filled leftist purple haired transgender dickheads high on social indignation? No. \nSo moderators, please, just tell the bastards to piss off and head bag to Bluesky and the the rest of us to enjoy our chat and maybe every now and again have a bloody laugh. \nHow hard is that and is it too much to ask?\n", "author": "Patriotrealm", "created": 1789712759757, "profile_picture": "EIlq25Xck8e3", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Dikt8ersalad", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Look, I write a lot of satire and try to make sense of the world . It is called Free Speech", "last_comment_created": 1789715174934, "content": "<p>Seriously, I am pro Trump. Yes, I am Australian.  But we down under need a Trump.  Yes, we speak differently to you guys. Our sense of humour and spelling can be confusing. But can we stop with the bot attacks and hate shit buggarising around?<br />\nAll around the world, people look to Donald Trump and what is wrong with that? Why do the lefties infest this place? Why? Because they hate us.\nI write serious articles and I write satire.  I have been here for quite a while. But lately, I have noticed a shift. There is nasty creeping in. I do not mind a bit of bullshit.. I often write bullshit.  But I do not come here to read the other kind of bullshit. My bullshit is writing about mystical mountains and rat reporters, not shit pretending to be factual. Can we just get back to being a place where we can come to appreciate the greatest President you have ever had and tell the trolls to fuck off please?\nIf I wanted to dump on Trump I would not be here.<br />\nMy wee blog is unashamedly pro Trump, pro historical fact and some personal observations. It also contains some satirical articles that stretch the bounds of human comprehension.\nDo I come here for the &quot; pleasure &quot; of reading crap from bots and hate filled leftist purple haired transgender dickheads high on social indignation? No.\nSo moderators, please, just tell the bastards to piss off and head bag to Bluesky and the the rest of us to enjoy our chat and maybe every now and again have a bloody laugh.\nHow hard is that and is it too much to ask?</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 5, "score_up": 11, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVM9QiTw", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 20, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8842080, "raw_content": "Here are the deals so far:  V- stands for Vessels.\n-China is the largest taker at around 10V - Unipec 8V, PetroChina 1V an Rongsheng 1V.\n\n-Korea follows with roughly 10V - split between S-Oil on 6V, GS Caltex 2V and HDO 2V.\n\n-Japan is heard at 2-4V - Idemitsu and ENEOS taking 1-2V apiece.\n\n-India is now possibly as high as 6V.\n\n-Exxon took 2V.", "author": "OrangeManNotBad", "created": 1789701005221, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "LordCommissarYarrick", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Several countries have paid Iran for tankers of oil to pass the strait of Hormuz.  Saudi Arabia paid Iran face to face to allow their vessels to move freely through the strait.", "last_comment_created": 1789703956374, "content": "<p>Here are the deals so far:  V- stands for Vessels.\n-China is the largest taker at around 10V - Unipec 8V, PetroChina 1V an Rongsheng 1V.</p>\n<p>-Korea follows with roughly 10V - split between S-Oil on 6V, GS Caltex 2V and HDO 2V.</p>\n<p>-Japan is heard at 2-4V - Idemitsu and ENEOS taking 1-2V apiece.</p>\n<p>-India is now possibly as high as 6V.</p>\n<p>-Exxon took 2V.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 20, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVM9QzX7", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 14, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "pepegif", "id": 8842189, "raw_content": "", "author": "DeploraBen", "created": 1789707988108, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_com